{"parse": {"title": "Calcified deposit", "pageid": 458451, "revid": 15192360, "redirects": [], "wikitext": {"*": "{{Infobox Item\n|name = Calcified deposit\n|image = [[File:Calcified deposit.png]]\n|release = [[20 March]] [[2024]]\n|update = Varlamore: Part One\n|members = Yes\n|quest = No\n|tradeable = No\n|bankable = Yes\n|equipable = No\n|stackable = No\n|noteable = No\n|options = Drop\n|examine = A deposit of calcified rock with bits of bone. It looks quite smashable.\n|value = 200\n|weight = 0.200\n|id = 29088\n|leagueRegion = Varlamore\n}}\n[[File:Calcified deposit detail.png|130px|left]]\n'''Calcified deposit''' is an item that can occasionally be obtained from [[mining]] [[calcified rocks]] in the [[Cam Torum mine]].\n\nIt can be crushed with a [[hammer]] by using it on an [[anvil]], producing [[blessed bone shards]] or [[calcified moth]]s. This process provides 1 [[Smithing]] experience and takes 3 ticks per deposit. On average, each deposit gives 7.5 shards.\n\n==Smithing info==\n{{Skill info\n|name = Calcified deposit\n|skill1name = Smithing\n|skill1lvl = 1\n|skill1exp = 1\n|facility = [[Anvil]]\n|tool = [[Hammer]]\n|timename = Duration\n|time = 3 [[tick]]s\n}}\n\n==Drops==\n{{DropLogProject|kills=1249|type=deposits}}\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Blessed bone shards|quantity=5-15|rarity=3/4|approx=Yes|skill=smithing|gemw=no}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Calcified moth|quantity=1|rarity=1/4|approx=Yes|skill=smithing|image=Calcified moth 1.png}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n==Item sources==\n{{Drop sources|Calcified deposit}}"}}, "fetchedAt": "2026-10-06T04:21:47.802990+00:00", "dropHtml": "<table class=\"wikitable sortable filterable item-drops autosort=4,a\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"border-right: none;\" class=\"drops-img-header drop-disp-btn unsortable\" title=\"Sort items by category, rarity and name.\"></th>\n<th style=\"border-left: none;\" class=\"item-col\">Item</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">Quantity</th>\n<t